{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01406",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 3.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Right then, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.19,
      "end_seconds": 8.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Hmm, morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.77,
      "end_seconds": 12.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.99,
      "end_seconds": 22.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "honestly, it's the room spinning when I turn over in bed, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.77,
      "end_seconds": 30.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "did it come on recently? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.58,
      "end_seconds": 36.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "For four weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.87,
      "end_seconds": 42.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.85,
      "end_seconds": 71.48,
      "duration_seconds": 27.63,
      "text": "It sort of comes and goes. I notice it more with looking up and turning in bed. I'd call it severe. I've also had being unsteady for a few minutes, since yesterday. As for feeling sick, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. As for feeling sick, mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.92,
      "end_seconds": 78.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.53,
      "end_seconds": 85.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "I'm allergic to plasters, I get a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.91,
      "end_seconds": 88.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.2,
      "end_seconds": 93.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I have acid reflux. I have asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.94,
      "end_seconds": 100.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Alright, acid reflux, that that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.98,
      "end_seconds": 120.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.61,
      "end_seconds": 123.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.17,
      "end_seconds": 128.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.74,
      "end_seconds": 136.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.49,
      "end_seconds": 140.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Right, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.48,
      "end_seconds": 146.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.03,
      "end_seconds": 149.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.51,
      "end_seconds": 156.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.31,
      "end_seconds": 159.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.66,
      "end_seconds": 161.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.86,
      "end_seconds": 167.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.47,
      "end_seconds": 172.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I take Asthalin inhaler, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.59,
      "end_seconds": 178.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any ringing in the ear or double vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.32,
      "end_seconds": 183.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.83,
      "end_seconds": 188.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any hearing loss or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.24,
      "end_seconds": 192.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Ah, no, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.05,
      "end_seconds": 196.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.42,
      "end_seconds": 199.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 200.53,
      "end_seconds": 209.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 86, temperature 36.5, saturation 99 percent, pressure 127 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.93,
      "end_seconds": 213.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.69,
      "end_seconds": 219.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.53,
      "end_seconds": 223.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.56,
      "end_seconds": 239.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "When I tip you back, the eyes flick for about twenty seconds, and the hearing is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.54,
      "end_seconds": 244.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.87,
      "end_seconds": 263.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with benign positional vertigo."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.69,
      "end_seconds": 266.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.89,
      "end_seconds": 273.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like benign positional vertigo."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.18,
      "end_seconds": 297.49,
      "duration_seconds": 14.31,
      "text": "I'll do a repositioning manoeuvre now and show you exercises for home. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.28,
      "end_seconds": 299.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "yes, that's manageable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.47,
      "end_seconds": 304.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.58,
      "end_seconds": 307.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.76,
      "end_seconds": 311.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}